- Study the source code.
- Modify copies locally for personal, non-commercial use.
- Contribute to the official repository through an authorized contributor branch and pull request.

## 3. RESTRICTIONS

Without prior written permission from the copyright holder, you may not:
- Republish or redistribute PyCraft or modified versions outside the permissions expressly granted by this license.
- Sell PyCraft, modified versions, or products substantially incorporating its source code.
- Use the project or its source code for commercial purposes.
- Present modified versions as official PyCraft releases.
